+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Extract the names of one certificate and of a repeated certificate list (packages/vite/src/node/__tests__/utils.spec.ts) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 Resolve the server URLs with no certificate, one and two certificates, for an IPv4 and an IPv6 address (packages/vite/src/node/__tests__/utils.spec.ts) [AC-2]
